    <%= raw(formula_html("performances")) %>
    A total of 21 shows were cancelled, 7 in each location. Cirque du Soleil's OVO was scheduled to stop at the Greensboro Coliseum (capacity 23,000) and Charlotte's Spectrum Center( formerly Time Warner Cable Arena, capacity 16,700).  Cirque du Soleil's TORUK was scheduled to stop at Raleigh's PNC arena (capacity 19,500).

    <%= raw(average_ticket_price(66.47, "Cirque du Soleil's OVO", "http://www.pollstar.com/atpDetail.aspx?SearchBy=C")) %>
    <%= raw(average_ticket_price(67.62, "Cirque du Soleil's TORUK", "http://www.pollstar.com/atpDetail.aspx?SearchBy=C")) %>

    <%= raw(hotel_html("Raleigh")) %>
    <%= raw(hotel_html("Charlotte")) %>
    <%= raw(hotel_html("Greensboro")) %>
  </p>
<% end %>

<% if (Loss.exists?(slug: 'demi-lovato-nick-jonas')) %>
<h4 id="demi-lovato-nick-jonas"><a href="<%= url_for('losses/demi-lovato-nick-jonas') %>" class="link">Demi Lovato and Nick Jonas</a></h4>
<p>
  <%= raw(formula_html("performances")) %>
  Two shows were cancelled, one at Charlotte's Spectrum Center( formerly Time Warner Cable Arena, capacity 16,700), and the other at Raleigh's PNC Arena (capacity 19,500).
  The ticket prices for the Raleigh show were used for both events. The Raleigh show prices are listed as <a href="https://www.thepncarena.com/events/detail/demi-lovato-2" class="link" target="blank">$26.95, $36.95, $66.95, and $86.95</a>. We averaged these for a final ticket price of $54.45.
  <%= raw(hotel_html("Raleigh")) %>  <%= raw(hotel_html("Charlotte")) %>
</p>
<% end %>


