<% if (Loss.exists?(slug: 'highpoint-market')) %>
  <h4 id="highpoint-market"><a href="<%= url_for('losses/highpoint-market') %>" class="link">Highpoint Market</a></h4>
  <p>This event loss figure was calculated as follows: The market has been cited as bringing <a href="http://www.hickoryrecord.com/news/crowd-thins-slightly-at-nc-furniture-market-after-lgbt-law/article_0063fe40-2429-11e6-bd3a-9baf79980be0.html" class="link" target="_blank">$5 billion</a> in economic activity to NC.  Attendance for the market dipped this year from <a href="http://www.hickoryrecord.com/news/crowd-thins-slightly-at-nc-furniture-market-after-lgbt-law/article_0063fe40-2429-11e6-bd3a-9baf79980be0.html" class="link" target="_blank">80,000 to 79,000</a>, which has been cited as a reversal for the market and correlated with HB2. <code>79/80 = x/5000000000 | x = 4937500000 | total = 5000000000 - 4937500000</code>
  </p>
<% end %>

